(7044449, 1070851, 30712, '<td valign="top">The richness of the colours here demands my attention.  This image is all about shape, texture and a feel for 3D.</td>', 'The richness of the colours here demands my attention.  This image is all about shape, texture and a feel for 3D.', '2013-05-29 02:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7044450, 1070590, 30712, '<td valign="top">The fact that the eyes are not looking straight at me adds to the 3D effect.  A lovely range of colours and textures.</td>', 'The fact that the eyes are not looking straight at me adds to the 3D effect.  A lovely range of colours and textures.', '2013-05-29 02:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7044451, 1070875, 29777, '<td valign="top">It took me a while to figure out what this was. The title was a help. I think this would have more impact if the lighting was a bit harder and enhanced the texture of the wood and the detail of the staples.</td>', 'It took me a while to figure out what this was. The title was a help. I think this would have more impact if the lighting was a bit harder and enhanced the texture of the wood and the detail of the staples.', '2013-05-29 02:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7044452, 1070939, 30712, '<td valign="top">There is really not enough in this image to demand my attention. For me something needs to be in focus.</td>', 'There is really not enough in this image to demand my attention. For me something needs to be in focus.', '2013-05-29 02:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7044454, 1070563, 29777, '<td valign="top">This first appears to be a texture study shot featuring the feathers. Then the baby''s head appears, but it is centered and out of focus. I would zoom in on the baby''s head and make sure the eye is in focus or zoom in on the feathers and fill the frame with that.</td>', 'This first appears to be a texture study shot featuring the feathers. Then the baby''s head appears, but it is centered and out of focus. I would zoom in on the baby''s head and make sure the eye is in focus or zoom in on the feathers and fill the frame with that.', '2013-05-29 02:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7044455, 1070891, 30712, '<td valign="top">A great idea.  It would be so much better if you had tried to reduce the extreme brightness of the view and made it more contrasty.  That would not in any way devalue the effect of the silhouette.</td>', 'A great idea.  It would be so much better if you had tried to reduce the extreme brightness of the view and made it more contrasty.  That would not in any way devalue the effect of the silhouette.', '2013-05-29 02:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7044457, 1070953, 29777, '<td valign="top">The bag seems too blend into the scene too much and then seems way out of place.</td>', 'The bag seems too blend into the scene too much and then seems way out of place.', '2013-05-29 02:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7044459, 1070711, 30712, '<td valign="top">I''d appreciate rather less light creeping round from the back which burns out the highlights and I''d like to see a sharper focus.  The flower doesn''t really benefit from the soft focus approach.  I''m not even sure that it''s a rose - a dahlia perhaps?</td>', 'I''d appreciate rather less light creeping round from the back which burns out the highlights and I''d like to see a sharper focus.  The flower doesn''t really benefit from the soft focus approach.  I''m not even sure that it''s a rose - a dahlia perhaps?', '2013-05-29 02:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
