(7045775, 1070651, 34337, '<td valign="top">totally great photo - don''t think it meets the challenge specs, so you may receive low numbers because of that.  Otherwise, awesome.</td>', 'totally great photo - don''t think it meets the challenge specs, so you may receive low numbers because of that.  Otherwise, awesome.', '2013-05-31 16:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7045777, 1070480, 34337, '<td valign="top">Great photo - could''ve used another crop closer on her face to fill the frame to fit the challenge exactly.</td>', 'Great photo - could''ve used another crop closer on her face to fill the frame to fit the challenge exactly.', '2013-05-31 16:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7045792, 1070328, 28427, '<td valign="top">Since I''m giving this a rather low score, I feel I ow you an explanation on the reason why.<br/>A few points seem to be missed during the execution of this photograph.<br/>I would preferred a focus on the eye itself instead of on the lashes at the bottom right.  <br/>The ring flash''s distracting.  I understand you''ve used a ring flash because of the macro.  But somehow I would have preferred seeing the reflection of a softbox. Or...the ring flash which was centred around the pupil.  Don''t know what effect this would have given; it''s just an idea you know.  But one I''m not totally convinced of myself.<br/>Your WB looks also off; as if you''ve shot this under a UV light.<br/>Perhaps all these points were intentional.  In this case I''m really ridiculing myself now.  If not intentional then this is worth giving it another try.  I do hope I''m not offending you with all this.</td>', 'Since I''m giving this a rather low score, I feel I ow you an explanation on the reason why.A few points seem to be missed during the execution of this photograph.I would preferred a focus on the eye itself instead of on the lashes at the bottom right.  The ring flash''s distracting.  I understand you''ve used a ring flash because of the macro.  But somehow I would have preferred seeing the reflection of a softbox. Or...the ring flash which was centred around the pupil.  Don''t know what effect this would have given; it''s just an idea you know.  But one I''m not totally convinced of myself.Your WB looks also off; as if you''ve shot this under a UV light.Perhaps all these points were intentional.  In this case I''m really ridiculing myself now.  If not intentional then this is worth giving it another try.  I do hope I''m not offending you with all this.', '2013-05-31 17:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7045797, 1070802, 28427, '<td valign="top">Such sad eyes.  In a way I''m missing his mouth.  But the colours: I love them!</td>', 'Such sad eyes.  In a way I''m missing his mouth.  But the colours: I love them!', '2013-05-31 18:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7045806, 1070641, 28427, '<td valign="top">Is it useful to say things as: I love the colours, I love the DOF, the focus?<br/>Probably not, because this would not be a "constructive" comment.  But, honestly, those are the only things I can say regarding your entry.  One of my favs and I do hope this will ribbon.</td>', 'Is it useful to say things as: I love the colours, I love the DOF, the focus?Probably not, because this would not be a "constructive" comment.  But, honestly, those are the only things I can say regarding your entry.  One of my favs and I do hope this will ribbon.', '2013-05-31 18:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7046009, 1070761, 162781, '<td valign="top">Nice!!</td>', 'Nice!!', '2013-06-01 08:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7046075, 1070940, 103032, '<td valign="top">Pensive.  Chaotic.  Alluring.  I think this will ribbon.</td>', 'Pensive.  Chaotic.  Alluring.  I think this will ribbon.', '2013-06-01 12:09:12.000000', NULL, 1);
