(7046682, 1070918, 68503, '<td valign="top">Im sure some are dinging your for him not being 100% of the frame but this can also be filling the frame as well IMO. My only critique it the lighting seems to be a little off, I dont know if its the shadow on the hat or just the fact his right side is too dark. Either way cute baby!</td>', 'Im sure some are dinging your for him not being 100% of the frame but this can also be filling the frame as well IMO. My only critique it the lighting seems to be a little off, I dont know if its the shadow on the hat or just the fact his right side is too dark. Either way cute baby!', '2013-06-02 16:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
