(7047599, 1070248, 102925, '<td valign="top">This is kind of all over the place. Yet it''s one of a few photos in this challenge that genuinely answer the brief (certainly does it better than my entry!). So for that I''m giving this a decent score :) Also there''s something quite nice about the chaos and jumble here. Unconventional and confusing, in a rather interesting way.</td>', 'This is kind of all over the place. Yet it''s one of a few photos in this challenge that genuinely answer the brief (certainly does it better than my entry!). So for that I''m giving this a decent score :) Also there''s something quite nice about the chaos and jumble here. Unconventional and confusing, in a rather interesting way.', '2013-06-04 01:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7047623, 1070494, 108069, '<td valign="top">This is probably the best photo I''ve ever seen. In my entire life. That sounds a little redundant. Can you sound a "little" redundant? It''s probably all or nothing, right? Is this out loud?</td>', 'This is probably the best photo I''ve ever seen. In my entire life. That sounds a little redundant. Can you sound a "little" redundant? It''s probably all or nothing, right? Is this out loud?', '2013-06-04 02:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
