(7047651, 1070366, 108069, '<td valign="top">I''m intrigued by this photo because you look like a man who wouldn''t want to interfere with anything getting jabbed into his mouth/throat, and yet here you are wearing a mask. Thought-provoking. But forget the psychology... <br/> <br/>This is an incredible photo. Technically perfect. Haunting. In our face.</td>', 'I''m intrigued by this photo because you look like a man who wouldn''t want to interfere with anything getting jabbed into his mouth/throat, and yet here you are wearing a mask. Thought-provoking. But forget the psychology...  This is an incredible photo. Technically perfect. Haunting. In our face.', '2013-06-04 05:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
