(7048109, 1070711, 54702, '<td valign="top">Yes, this photo is of a red and white Dahlia, not a rose.  The title "Painting the Roses Red" comes from a line in Alice in Wonderland which the duel color reminded me of.  Thank you to everyone who commented and voted.</td>', 'Yes, this photo is of a red and white Dahlia, not a rose.  The title "Painting the Roses Red" comes from a line in Alice in Wonderland which the duel color reminded me of.  Thank you to everyone who commented and voted.', '2013-06-05 02:01:20.000000', NULL, 0),
