(7048153, 1070366, 20799, '<td valign="top">This is still a ribbon worthy shot, your finest self-portrait (not because your face is covered). Congrats on the TT, I have no clue how this didn''t make it in the top 3.</td>', 'This is still a ribbon worthy shot, your finest self-portrait (not because your face is covered). Congrats on the TT, I have no clue how this didn''t make it in the top 3.', '2013-06-05 04:15:10.000000', NULL, 0),
