(7048313, 1070590, 68503, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments guys! Great start to the finals for TPL!<br/> <br/>I forgot to put the description when I posted, but this was taken during the Renaissance Faire a couple of weekends ago. As soon as I saw this guy I knew he would fit the challenge perfectly. There was a couple of other unique characters there as you can imagine, but I wasnt able to capture them at the right angle. If you have never attended a Ren Faire I would strongly suggest it, they are a great time and relatively inexpensive for the family.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments guys! Great start to the finals for TPL! I forgot to put the description when I posted, but this was taken during the Renaissance Faire a couple of weekends ago. As soon as I saw this guy I knew he would fit the challenge perfectly. There was a couple of other unique characters there as you can imagine, but I wasnt able to capture them at the right angle. If you have never attended a Ren Faire I would strongly suggest it, they are a great time and relatively inexpensive for the family.', '2013-06-05 11:35:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(7048315, 1070286, 138630, '<td valign="top">Well done capture that met the challenge well and a fine finish, Kelli.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Well done capture that met the challenge well and a fine finish, Kelli.  Congratulations.', '2013-06-05 11:40:09.000000', NULL, 0),
